\f0\fs24 \cf0 Rotary international was having a conference in Australia and I worked with their Western districts, the big west, to create a small campaign for the event. \
\
This campaign included signage, apparel and a small gift of the story telling about their campaign.\
For this campaign it focused on a logo mark that was inspired by the rotary gear, its principles and the indigenous cultural of Australia.\
\
I focused on the four principles of rotary, individual, unity, guidance and prosperity as well as traditional colors found in aboriginal art. The style of the signage, story telling and mark also focused on the dotted aesthetic of aboriginal art.\
\
This campaign was called dreams of progress and was a huge success in an international event. }